<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετρόβολ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throwing
			stones</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετροβόλος, ὁ</span>, <i>engine for throwing stones</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.4.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				41.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				34.2
			</span></i>, etc.; distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπέλτης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.7.2
			</span></i> (but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπέλτας ὀξυβελεῖς τε καὶ πετροβόλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.51
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.468.1
			</span></i>): neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετροβόλα</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανα</span>), opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορυβόλα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				9.10.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sling</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ki.</u>
				14.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθοι πετρόβολοι</span>
			<i>hurled as from a sling</i>, of hailstones, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ez.</u>
				13.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>.</div>
